WEBVTT

00:00:00.593 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.406 --> 00:00:04.933
A beautiful, clear price list helps customers decide faster,

00:00:04.883 --> 00:00:08.990
and saves your team from answering the same questions again and again.

00:00:09.419 --> 00:00:12.977
In this lesson, I'll show you how to make a price list for your salon,

00:00:12.927 --> 00:00:14.030
in several languages,

00:00:14.165 --> 00:00:15.790
with a QR code for booking.

00:00:16.059 --> 00:00:19.150
It's completely free, and you don't need any design skills.

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:25.716
Open varaaai.com, scroll to the bottom of the page, and tap Free price list maker.

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:26.836
Step one:

00:00:27.185 --> 00:00:31.716
under Salon details, enter your Salon name, address and phone number.

00:00:32.394 --> 00:00:33.167
Step two:

00:00:33.276 --> 00:00:34.847
Languages and currency.

00:00:35.196 --> 00:00:39.982
Tap Add language to choose the languages on your price list, for example Finnish,

00:00:39.932 --> 00:00:41.327
English and Vietnamese.

00:00:41.736 --> 00:00:46.127
You can show up to three side by side, and the first one is the main language.

00:00:46.316 --> 00:00:47.647
Then choose your currency.

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:49.003
Step three:

00:00:49.113 --> 00:00:50.683
Services and prices.

00:00:51.062 --> 00:00:56.603
Tap one of the ready-made categories, like Nails, Hair salon, or Spa and massage.

00:00:56.872 --> 00:01:01.963
Then tap Add service, and fill in the service name, the price, and the minutes.

00:01:02.312 --> 00:01:05.403
If the price is only a starting price, tick From price.

00:01:05.751 --> 00:01:08.123
You can also add a short description to each service.

00:01:08.717 --> 00:01:09.567
Step four:

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:10.927
Booking QR code.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:13.152
Paste your salon's booking page link,

00:01:13.102 --> 00:01:16.766
so customers can scan the code on your price list and book straight away.

00:01:17.291 --> 00:01:18.207
Step five:

00:01:18.316 --> 00:01:19.087
Design.

00:01:19.435 --> 00:01:21.007
Choose one of three styles:

00:01:21.103 --> 00:01:23.487
Minimal, Luxury, or Colorful.

00:01:23.757 --> 00:01:26.127
Then choose a Main color, and the Format.

00:01:26.733 --> 00:01:29.891
When you're done, tap Preview to see the finished price list.

00:01:29.999 --> 00:01:33.159
Tap Download PDF to print it for the counter,

00:01:33.109 --> 00:01:36.131
or Download PNG to post it on social media.

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:39.803
If you sign in, you can also save the price list to your account,

00:01:39.753 --> 00:01:41.011
and edit it again later.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:42.611
Now take the quiz below.
